  },
  {
    "insert": "Success criteria is missing. An example success criteria can be \"We will apply our treatment plans in ABC Clinic across 100 adenocarcinoma patients. For 2 years we will conduct a live-survey under adenocarcinoma patients from various stages as well as the clinicians, who made use of our developed model. If healing rate is up to 10% of what it's been before (here may be a reference to an existing literature source), then we consider it a success\". "
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "I missed the ethical part. The ethical part is crucial, if you want to work with real-life data."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Don't afraid to be "
  },
